{"c":[{"id":"f2649e800ab24c86","sum":"Host gate, surfaces and perch need FocusedFieldSnapshot.caretRectAX (caretRect is AppKit bottom-left). fill_acceptance popup needs the reader with --act-pids, or the executor stops notAllowed ('The form changed').","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T054535Z-cd383e079c08d5e3","text":"Host: KeyType's FocusedFieldSnapshot.caretRect is AppKit (bottom-left); the gate, surfaces and perch need FocusedFieldSnapshot.caretRectAX, or the gate tests a mirrored point and holds ghost text as covered.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T054535Z-f725bb7f07997327","text":"fill_acceptance popup needs the reader started with --act-pids: the executor writes through reader verbs, and without it the run stops with notAllowed and the host shows 'The form changed'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5b3a9b25ba5ddf8e","sum":"A10: SurfaceGate skips elevated windows covering a whole display (Snipaste's layer-25 one) or every offer is held covered; KeyType puts a filled single-line field's caret at its bottom edge, so fit checks add no height below the caret.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T124605Z-cfb4c770396b2ce0","text":"Snipaste keeps a layer-25 alpha-1 window around the main display; SurfaceGate skips elevated windows containing a whole display, or every offer is held as covered (A10).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T124605Z-ed64edafa04a21d4","text":"KeyType estimates a single-line field's caret flush with the field's bottom edge once it holds text; fit checks must not add height below the caret (A10 cd92606).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
